{"CFDocument":{"identifier":"90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003","creator":"PCG - Equity","title":"Five Pillars of Educational Equity","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00","adoptionStatus":"Draft"},"CFItems":[{"identifier":"b181a90e-6243-11eb-a465-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/b181a90e-6243-11eb-a465-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"There is a shared understanding of the terms equity and equitable as they are applied to policies, procedures, and quality instruction to ensure high expectations and outcomes for all student populations.","humanCodingScheme":"Pillar I","abbreviatedStatement":"Student Achievement","notes":"This document makes use of the following definitions:\r\n\r\n* Equity: Ensuring high outcomes for all students by interrupting inequitable practices, examining unconscious biases, and creating a safe, inclusive, and multicultural environment for the school community.\r\n* Equity Lens: A process for reviewing, designing and diagnosing the impact of policies, practices, and procedures for under-served and marginalized student groups.\r\n* Cultural Competence: The ability to recognize differences based on a culture, language, race, gender, ethnicity and other aspects of individual identity and to respond to those differences positively and constructively.","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"d938a2d6-6243-11eb-805f-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/d938a2d6-6243-11eb-805f-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"The implementation of efficient and effective policies is focused on analyzing and improving outcomes proportionally, policies that are culturally appropriate for each student group.","humanCodingScheme":"Pillar II","abbreviatedStatement":"Disciplinary Practices and Procedures","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"e9fe2adc-6243-11eb-b53b-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/e9fe2adc-6243-11eb-b53b-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Ensuring that instructional resources and programming are focused on providing access to quality instruction for all student populations, regardless of gender, ethnic origin, and/or socioeconomic status.","humanCodingScheme":"Pillar III","abbreviatedStatement":"High-Quality Programming and High-Quality Teachers","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"f7f4c150-6243-11eb-8fee-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/f7f4c150-6243-11eb-8fee-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Resources, including people, time and funding, are allocated to create student experiences and provide access to rigorous learning outcomes, regardless of gender, ethnic origin or socioeconomic status.","humanCodingScheme":"Pillar IV","abbreviatedStatement":"Distribution of Funding and Resources","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"0575d68e-6244-11eb-84eb-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/0575d68e-6244-11eb-84eb-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Ensuring all stakeholders (including leaders, teachers and students) create, maintain, and enhance a shared set of beliefs, values, and assumptions which celebrate diversity and creates a positive and inclusive learning environment.","humanCodingScheme":"Pillar V","abbreviatedStatement":"School Culture and Climate","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"1be3b648-6244-11eb-b1c0-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/1be3b648-6244-11eb-b1c0-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"There is a shared understanding of state and district policies and expectations relating to student outcomes for all student sub-groups.","humanCodingScheme":"I.1","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"2a5f4a98-6244-11eb-9641-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/2a5f4a98-6244-11eb-9641-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Instructional staff hold each other accountable for the success of students from all ethnic backgrounds and those who identify as LGBTQIA+, not just students in their own classrooms.","humanCodingScheme":"I.2","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"2bda24a6-6244-11eb-9bd3-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/2bda24a6-6244-11eb-9bd3-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"There are measurable equity and inclusion goals addressing the needs of all students shared with instructional staff that can be monitored with fidelity.","humanCodingScheme":"I.3","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"2d33b15a-6244-11eb-aac3-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/2d33b15a-6244-11eb-aac3-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Instructional staff routinely examine data by grade level and sub-groups such as discipline infractions, attendance, grades, student performance, test scores, graduation rates, promotion and retention, etc. and use the findings to drive equitable school wide policies and procedures.","humanCodingScheme":"I.4","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"2ec38d56-6244-11eb-b9bb-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/2ec38d56-6244-11eb-b9bb-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Data teams address problems of practice that have emerged from the review of student data with equitable solutions that consider the diverse academic and socio-emotional needs of all students.","humanCodingScheme":"I.5","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"30149268-6244-11eb-bdb1-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/30149268-6244-11eb-bdb1-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"The school has a culture that encourages teachers to use data to develop and deliver their instruction through an equitable lens.","humanCodingScheme":"I.6","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"3164179c-6244-11eb-bccb-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/3164179c-6244-11eb-bccb-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Decisions around instructional support, progress-monitoring techniques, and professional development are driven by data disaggregated by gender, race, ethnicity, language, etc.","humanCodingScheme":"I.7","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"32f6aebc-6244-11eb-8124-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/32f6aebc-6244-11eb-8124-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Problem-solving teams are set up and given responsibility for designing and implementing equitable student support initiatives (informal, before/after school, individualized, etc.).","humanCodingScheme":"I.8","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"34823346-6244-11eb-a670-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/34823346-6244-11eb-a670-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"The school has a multi-tiered approach for monitoring and evaluating the effectiveness of student supports (i.e. MTSS Tier 1, Tier 2, Tier 3).","humanCodingScheme":"I.9","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"99063fec-6244-11eb-ab63-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/99063fec-6244-11eb-ab63-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"School System Leaders","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"9f12fbbe-6244-11eb-a883-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/9f12fbbe-6244-11eb-a883-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"School Administrators","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"a30a1d2e-6244-11eb-b227-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/a30a1d2e-6244-11eb-b227-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Teachers","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"a71319e8-6244-11eb-925b-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/a71319e8-6244-11eb-925b-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Students","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"c7d34798-6244-11eb-892c-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/c7d34798-6244-11eb-892c-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"State and district policies have been made available to all educational stakeholders in an understandable and accessible format.","humanCodingScheme":"SL.I.1.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"d4ddb64e-6244-11eb-b164-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/d4ddb64e-6244-11eb-b164-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Leaders, administrators and teachers are accountable for obtaining and understanding state and district policies.","humanCodingScheme":"SL.I.1.b","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"081c1bc2-6245-11eb-a3ea-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/081c1bc2-6245-11eb-a3ea-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Materials related to state and district policies have been made available to all educators.","humanCodingScheme":"SA.I.1.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"0a1fa6aa-6245-11eb-a588-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/0a1fa6aa-6245-11eb-a588-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Communication with educators stresses the importance of learning and implementing state and district policies.","humanCodingScheme":"SA.I.1.b","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"0f554c06-6245-11eb-9656-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/0f554c06-6245-11eb-9656-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Teachers have obtained, learned and internalized state and district equity policies.","humanCodingScheme":"T.I.1.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"1184db2c-6245-11eb-96ea-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/1184db2c-6245-11eb-96ea-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Teachers can describe state and district policies accurately.","humanCodingScheme":"T.I.1.b","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"166354de-6245-11eb-822b-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/166354de-6245-11eb-822b-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Students are aware of relevant elements of state and district policies related to their responsibilities as part of the school.","humanCodingScheme":"S.I.1.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"6511eae6-6245-11eb-8561-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/6511eae6-6245-11eb-8561-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"School System Leaders","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"65123870-6245-11eb-8e83-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/65123870-6245-11eb-8e83-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Programs and resources are available for administrators and teachers to learn about and practice effective and respectful accountability measures related to equity.","humanCodingScheme":"SL.I.2.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"67ddc786-6245-11eb-a8b1-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/67ddc786-6245-11eb-a8b1-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"School Administrators","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"67de0912-6245-11eb-b8b7-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/67de0912-6245-11eb-b8b7-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Staff are encouraged to work together and hold each other accountable for meeting equity goals.","humanCodingScheme":"SA.I.2.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"6b30ee90-6245-11eb-a054-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/6b30ee90-6245-11eb-a054-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Teachers","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"6b3123a6-6245-11eb-94d6-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/6b3123a6-6245-11eb-94d6-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Teachers work together and hold each other accountable for meeting equity goals.","humanCodingScheme":"T.I.2.a","language":"en","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"},{"identifier":"6dd91d7a-6245-11eb-8f6c-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/6dd91d7a-6245-11eb-8f6c-0242ac160003","fullStatement":"Students","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00"}],"CFAssociations":[{"identifier":"b184cfc6-6243-11eb-9e0c-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/b184cfc6-6243-11eb-9e0c-0242ac160003","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00","sequenceNumber":1,"originNodeURI":{"title":"Pillar I","identifier":"b181a90e-6243-11eb-a465-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/b181a90e-6243-11eb-a465-0242ac160003"},"associationType":"isChildOf","destinationNodeURI":{"title":"Five Pillars of Educational Equity","identifier":"90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003"}},{"identifier":"d93aefbe-6243-11eb-b780-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/d93aefbe-6243-11eb-b780-0242ac160003","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00","sequenceNumber":2,"originNodeURI":{"title":"Pillar II","identifier":"d938a2d6-6243-11eb-805f-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/d938a2d6-6243-11eb-805f-0242ac160003"},"associationType":"isChildOf","destinationNodeURI":{"title":"Five Pillars of Educational Equity","identifier":"90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/90bd3abc-6243-11eb-b5bd-0242ac160003"}},{"identifier":"ea004b5a-6243-11eb-ac3f-0242ac160003","uri":"http://sandbox.opensalt.net/uri/ea004b5a-6243-11eb-ac3f-0242ac160003","lastChangeDateTime":"2021-01-29T17:03:53+00:00","sequenceNumber":3,"originNodeURI":{"title":"Pillar III","identifier":"e9fe2adc-6243-11eb-b53b-0242